title: "Layer Selection in Protein Language Models Improves Kinase Functional Classification"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-10-07
url: "https://github.com/jhaaj08/Kinases-Clustering"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jhaaj08/Kinases-Clustering"
